    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45100" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐσεβ-έω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>live</i> or <i>act piously</i> or <i>reverently</i>,
